+            </Step>
+            <Step number="03" title="Verify, then explore">
+              Connect with a read-only check. Review actual returned orders and start with the
+              isolated paper wallet.
+            </Step>
+          </Panel>
+          <div className="audit-callout">
+            <FileJson2 size={22} />
+            <h3>Built from your collection.</h3>
+            <p>
+              No borrowed exchange APIs. No assumed authentication. Every supported request has a
